  "_doc": "Per-component and project-wide caps on viewport escape-hatch debt. Read by viewport-coverage.test.ts (checkEscapeHatchBudget). Re-baselined 2026-05-22: each cap is set to the component's then-current actual opt-out count plus 1 (single-opt-out headroom). This removes dead slack that accumulated as debt was paid down -- it is NOT lowering caps below current usage to force refactoring. Policy: one justified opt-out in a component passes without a bump; a cluster of new opt-outs requires a visible, reviewable budget increase in the same PR. Bump 'total' alongside any per-component increase.",
